            "value": "Este servidor não suporta OCR. É necessário o Trilium 0.103 ou posterior."
          }
        },
        "ro": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Acest server nu acceptă OCR. Este necesar Trilium 0.103 sau mai nou."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tento server nepodporuje OCR. Vyžaduje sa Trilium 0.103 alebo novšie."
          }
        },
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta strežnik ne podpira OCR. Potreben je Trilium 0.103 ali novejši."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Den här servern stöder inte OCR. Trilium 0.103 eller senare krävs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This server's database schema (v%1$d) is newer than what this build of Triquid Notes (tested through Trilium %2$@, db v%3$d) has been verified against. New note types or fields may not display correctly until Triquid Notes is updated.": {
      "comment": "Settings: server db version warning. %1$d server db, %2$@ tested Trilium tag, %3$d tested db.",
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
