    "This server's sync protocol (v%1$d) is newer than what this build of Triquid Notes (tested through Trilium %2$@, sync v%3$d) has been verified against. Incremental sync may misbehave; full-sync from Settings if you see stale data.": {
      "comment": "Settings: server sync version warning. %1$d server sync, %2$@ tested Trilium tag, %3$d tested sync.",
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
